{"data":{"id":"Mrq5y6G0TmA","slug":"pheo","title":"Pheo","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"vTqtffF_QR8","slug":"picky-eaters-joe-kays-slowed-version","title":"Picky Eaters (Joe Kay's Slowed Version)"},{"id":"BMG225pbTyw","slug":"old-cigars-joe-kays-roll-one-version","title":"Old Cigars (Joe Kay's 'Roll One' Version)"},{"id":"-dbsyEa4TVg","slug":"picky-eaters-edit","title":"Picky Eaters_edit"},{"id":"6AUD5mS7mDI","slug":"nyquil","title":"Nyquil"},{"id":"A0yTVLIWpX8","slug":"go-get-it","title":"Go Get It"},{"id":"Z2QnCcZ9QqQ","slug":"go-get-it-feat-cashius-green","title":"Go Get It (feat. Cashius Green)"},{"id":"ZYnXNSIhpVg","slug":"real-old-cigar-joe-kays-slowed-and-roll-one-edit","title":"Real Old Cigar (Joe Kay's Slowed & Roll One Edit)"},{"id":"iObjzA6TBxo","slug":"real-old-cigar","title":"Real Old Cigar"}]},"markers":[{"id":"yh-mtZxLaZY","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pheo - Old Cigars (Joe Kay's 'Roll One' Version)","track":{"id":"BMG225pbTyw","path":"/artists/pheo/tracks/old-cigars-joe-kay-s-roll-one-version/","slug":"old-cigars-joe-kays-roll-one-version","title":"Old Cigars (Joe Kay's 'Roll One' Version)","artist":{"slug":"pheo","title":"Pheo"},"artwork":"images/artists/pheo/tracks/old-cigars-joe-kay-s-roll-one-version.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"7vHj7jlvMRk","slug":"156","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-156-w-j"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #156 w/ J-Louis","artwork":"/images/episodes/156.jpg","content":"Joe Kay is joined by Soulection's very own iPhone producer J-Louis.\n\n<!--more-->\nAs some of you may or may not know, J-Louis produces all his music on the iPhone [(Nano Studio App)](https://apps.apple.com/gb/developer/blip-interactive-ltd/id382263654?at=1010lMz4). He even put out a free EP with us in the beginning of the year entitled [\"Balanced\"](https://soulection.bandcamp.com/album/balanced-ep) which was also produced entirely on the iPhone. This 20 year-old from Azusa, CA is really a special guy who we feel is going to be BIG in the near future as long as he stays on track with his progression.\n\nJ-Louis played an exclusive set for a little over 30 minutes with all his recent unreleased productions and then chopped it up with us about his musical background (Drummer since he was 8 years-old & played in a Hardcore band & toured when he was 12) and how he purchased a stolen Macbook Pro (without knowing) to start producing on a computer that was eventually stolen -- forcing him to produce on his iPhone again. \n\nWhat a journey! Joe Kay also made sure to talk about his experience at the Yeezus tour this past Friday and later went into a heavy discussion about rumors of Soulection being part of Free-masonry/Illuminati. Very interesting and informative conversations going on as always.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10844,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"FMFGbDSP2hQ","position":14,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pheo - Picky Eaters (Joe Kay's Slowed Version)","track":{"id":"vTqtffF_QR8","path":"/artists/pheo/tracks/picky-eaters-joe-kay-s-slowed-version/","slug":"picky-eaters-joe-kays-slowed-version","title":"Picky Eaters (Joe Kay's Slowed Version)","artist":{"slug":"pheo","title":"Pheo"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"72tsP5bkPCY","slug":"157","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-157"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #157","artwork":"/images/episodes/157.jpg","content":"Joe Kay drops a 60 minute set of some stand out selects that he either just discovered, was holding onto, and rediscovered. \n\n<!--more-->\nWe played back a few cuts from last week such as the intro track by Yung Gud! God this track is a bad one even Sango is opening up with it at his recent shows.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":3723,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-21T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"WojksGG8WP0","position":50,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pheo. - Real Old Cigar","track":{"id":"iObjzA6TBxo","path":"/artists/pheo/tracks/real-old-cigar/","slug":"real-old-cigar","title":"Real Old Cigar","artist":{"slug":"pheo","title":"Pheo"},"artwork":"images/artists/pheo/tracks/real-old-cigar.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"nbke6-Mfddk","slug":"161","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-161"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #161","artwork":"/images/episodes/161.jpg","content":"Joe focuses on new tracks from forthcoming Soulection releases.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJoe also announced some hints about what to expect in the coming months. We have so much in store for you. \nWe're only a couple of weeks in to the new year and already we feel like we have hit some milestones. \n\nStay tuned. \n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10868,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"f48iN30hV9k","position":41,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pheo. - Real Old Cigar","track":{"id":"iObjzA6TBxo","path":"/artists/pheo/tracks/real-old-cigar/","slug":"real-old-cigar","title":"Real Old Cigar","artist":{"slug":"pheo","title":"Pheo"},"artwork":"images/artists/pheo/tracks/real-old-cigar.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"MUTAwmt5Mm0","slug":"173","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-173"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #173","artwork":"/images/episodes/173.jpg","content":"Joe Kay makes it to the studio in time to throw down an unforgettable set full of primarily forgotten classics that will have you reminiscing on life.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAs if this news isn't enough, we just hit 100K here on Soundcloud this past Friday literally while we launched our new residency @ the legendary Echoplex! Talk about timing and accomplishments. THANK you to each and every one of you for supporting us and spreading this sound to everyone. We plan to give you something really soon to celebrate 100K supporters worldwide and more. Big ups to the 900+ people who showed up to The Sound of Tomorrow this past Friday. Very inspiring.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10836,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-05-03T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"zdyrys0PBNE","position":56,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pheo. - Real Old Cigar","track":{"id":"iObjzA6TBxo","path":"/artists/pheo/tracks/real-old-cigar/","slug":"real-old-cigar","title":"Real Old Cigar","artist":{"slug":"pheo","title":"Pheo"},"artwork":"images/artists/pheo/tracks/real-old-cigar.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"JzAXADeB_WI","slug":"200","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/show-200-celebration-of-life"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #200 (Celebration of Life)","artwork":"/images/episodes/200.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11158,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-01-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"fFKHjP-ULW4","position":1,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pheo. - Real Old Cigar","track":{"id":"iObjzA6TBxo","path":"/artists/pheo/tracks/real-old-cigar/","slug":"real-old-cigar","title":"Real Old Cigar","artist":{"slug":"pheo","title":"Pheo"},"artwork":"images/artists/pheo/tracks/real-old-cigar.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"JqD6pzItSjA","slug":"207","tags":[4,7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/